stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disconnected
    Disconnected --> Connected: negotiate
    Connected --> HalfOpen: link stalls
    HalfOpen --> Disconnected: deadline
    Connected --> Disconnected: host restart
    Connected --> Disconnected: guest restart
        [*] --> Absent
        Absent --> Running: reserve and spawn
        Running --> Terminal: reap child
        Terminal --> Released: host records result
